--- !u!114 &1198066292
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1198066290}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.82, g: 0.76, b: 0.68, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 24
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.15
  m_Text: '<b>CONTROLS</b>

    Move  WASD      Look  Mouse      Lock on  Tab / Middle
    Mouse

    Light  Left Mouse      Heavy  Shift + Left Mouse      Special  E

    Guard 
    Right Mouse      Parry  Q      Roll  Space      Flask  R      Swap weapon  V


    <b>HOW
    TO SURVIVE</b>

    <b>Deflect</b>   tap Guard just as a blow lands. It costs
    him posture, not you.

    <b>Parry</b>   Q in time turns a blow aside and staggers
    him. Some blows cannot be parried: roll those.

    <b>Perfect roll</b>   roll
    through a blow at the last moment to open a counter.

    <b>Posture</b>   fill
    his posture bar and he breaks. Strike the broken guard for a riposte.

    <b>Wrath</b>  
    with a full focus meter, hold Guard and press E: eight seconds of harder, faster
    swings.

    <b>Air</b>   Heavy out of a roll launches you; Light and Heavy aloft
    cut and plunge.


    <b>HE LEARNS</b>

    Igris watches what you repeat and
    answers it, and tells you when he does. Change your habit and the answer fades.
    Lose, and he remembers you on the next attempt.'
--- !u!222 &1198066293
